WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.675
The front desk opens the club dashboard.

00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:11.894
Search the member directory by name.

00:00:11.894 --> 00:00:19.578
Open Elena’s record and review her current membership.

00:00:19.578 --> 00:00:25.544
The preview shows the new dates and fee before anything is saved.

00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:30.200
Confirmation records the renewal in the member’s history.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.575
The club calendar brings court activities into one schedule.

00:00:34.575 --> 00:00:37.698
Start a booking and choose the centre court.

00:00:37.698 --> 00:00:40.957
Select the member who will play.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:44.979
Only available times can be selected for the chosen day.

00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:50.914
Review the court, player, time and applicable fee together.

00:00:50.914 --> 00:01:01.352
The booking is saved. The calendar shows the updated schedule.
